// Attributes understood by rpcgen. Application schemas include this.

/// On a `ubyte` enum: the services one server offers. Each value names an
/// `rpc_service` in the same namespace, and is that service's wire id. Append
/// only; mark removed services `(deprecated)` instead of deleting them.
/// Methods get their wire id from their position in the `rpc_service`, so the
/// same rule applies to them.
attribute "rpc_server";

/// Unary calls: deadline in milliseconds (default 5000).
attribute "timeout_ms";
